{"id":"665748","name":"白灼竹笋虾","author":"给宝贝做的饭","authorId":"1900992","desc":"","cover":"images/665748/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"竹笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒸鱼豉油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"竹笋清洗一下泡半个小时。","img":"images/665748/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅里水烧开，加入油和盐下入竹笋，开锅后焯5分钟。捞出过凉水沥干水分。","img":"images/665748/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"虾仁开背去虾线、焯熟。","img":"images/665748/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"摆入盘中。","img":"images/665748/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"葱切细丝在凉水中泡一下。点缀在虾上。","img":"images/665748/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒸鱼鼓油加水熬开浇在菜上。","img":"images/665748/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用热油激一下即可。","img":"images/665748/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成品图","img":"images/665748/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}